# Environment variables for local development.
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the values; .env.local is not committed.
#
# Every variable the app reads is listed here with a comment, and validated at startup by the
# schema in src/shared/config/env/schema.ts. To add a variable, add a field to that schema and a
# line with a comment here.
#
# No variables are needed yet.
